### What I saw

Plan 50 is over-built relative to two cheap corpus checks: the scrubber, the ratchet and RB-4 cost more than they return, while the model-declaration corpus check, the catalog dry run and a journey that runs in minutes would have caught most of the week's failures. This is a challenge to a queued plan, so it is settled in Plan 50's own owner decision D1, not by a new task.

Source: Fable critique of Plan 50, 12 Nov (smell 7; `briefs/wave3/critique-plan50.md`) (interim file `observations/2026-11-12-plan-50-over-built.md`, 2026-11-12)

